sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Itaú / Cielo
  participant GW as Payment Gateway
  participant B as Billing (OrderSettlement)
  participant WD as webhook-delivery
  participant M as Merchant

  P->>GW: trigger: webhook · poll · reconciliation
  GW->>P: ask the bank / acquirer
  P-->>GW: paid, amount, ids
  GW->>GW: one transaction: state change + outbox row
  GW->>B: relay: internal listeners first
  B->>B: order PAID (idempotent by message id)
  GW->>WD: then the merchant event
  WD-)M: signed POST payment.completed
  Note over WD,M: non-2xx: backoff retries, then DEAD<br/>redeliver: /v1/webhooks/deliveries
